20260922 035643.494 INFO             PET0     ESMX_Driver: index=  94                                  MPIR_CVAR_OFI_CXI_PID_BASE : Set to the base value that MPI will use to assign portal IDs for the CXI provider.  Max PID value is 510.  MPI uses PID_BASE+lrank as the unique value per rank per node.  This is only applicable to SS11.
