20260922 035643.494 INFO             PET1     ESMX_Driver: index=  40                                    MPIR_CVAR_ALLTOALL_BATCH : If set, the optimized MPI_Alltoall batches small-sized Irecv messages and posts them together with libfabric's FI_MORE flag. Default: set
20260922 035643.494 INFO             PET1     ESMX_Driver: index=  41                     MPIR_CVAR_ALLTOALL_BATCH_SHORT_MSG_SIZE : Payload sizes less than or equal to this threshold value can use the Alltoall batching optimization. This variable has no effect if MPIR_CVAR_ALLTOALL_BATCH is set to 0. Default: 4096
