20260922 035643.494 INFO             PET1     ESMX_Driver: index=  70                MPIR_CVAR_MPIIO_OFI_STARTUP_NODES_AGGREGATOR : If MPIIO_OFI_STARTUP_CONNECT is enabled, this specifies the number of nodes that will concurrently attempt to connext to each aggrgator. Each rank on each node will establish its own connection to the aggregator. Default: 2
20260922 035643.494 INFO             PET1     ESMX_Driver: index=  71                                           MPIR_CVAR_DPM_DIR : Sets the directory to use for MPI port name publishing in the  file-based nameserv implementation.
20260922 035643.494 INFO             PET1     ESMX_Driver: index=  72                            MPIR_CVAR_OFI_CXI_COUNTER_REPORT : Determine if CXI counters are collected during the job, and the verbosity  of the counter data report that is displayed during MPI_Finalize. Recognized values are between 0 and 5. _CTR_REPORT_DISABLE      0 - no CXI counters are collected _CTR_REPORT_DEFAULT      1 - network timeout counters collected, 1-line display _CTR_REPORT_SUMMARY      2 - #1 + CXI counters collected, summary report displayed _CTR_REPORT_ON_ERROR     3 - #2 + displays counter data for nodes that hit a timeout _CTR_REPORT_ALL_ON_ERROR 4 - #2 + displays all node counter data if a timeout occured _CTR_REPORT_ALL          5 - #2 + displays all node counter data
