20260922 035643.494 INFO             PET3     ESMX_Driver: index=  70                MPIR_CVAR_MPIIO_OFI_STARTUP_NODES_AGGREGATOR : If MPIIO_OFI_STARTUP_CONNECT is enabled, this specifies the number of nodes that will concurrently attempt to connext to each aggrgator. Each rank on each node will establish its own connection to the aggregator. Default: 2
