20260922 035643.494 INFO             PET3     ESMX_Driver: index=  78                            MPIR_CVAR_OFI_HWCOLL_CONCURRENCY : Specifies the number of concurrent hardware collective operations on a single MPI collective call. Most hwcolls are limited to four 8-byte values. With concurrency settings, this could increase by 8X, ie. thirty-two 8-byte values. Using this option does require more hardware resources. Hardware supports a  max of 8 concurrent options. Valid values: 1 through 8.
20260922 035643.494 INFO             PET3     ESMX_Driver: index=  79                              MPIR_CVAR_OFI_HWCOLL_MIN_NODES : Set to the minimum number of nodes required in the communicator for  hardware collectives to be attempted. For small communicators, we don't expect hwcolls to be useful. The default is set to the value retrieved from the env var FI_CXI_HWCOLL_MIN_NODES which is set by PALs, but can be overridden by the user.
