20260922 035643.494 INFO             PET3     ESMX_Driver: index=  81                                MPIR_CVAR_OFI_HWCOLL_VERBOSE : If set to 1 or higher, enables verbose output about the OFI hardware  collectives. Higher values will produce more verbose output.
20260922 035643.494 INFO             PET3     ESMX_Driver: index=  82                        MPIR_CVAR_OFI_MPI_HWCOLL_GPU_SUPPORT : If set to 1, MPI provides GPU support for the HW collective allreduce and bcast  algorithms by copying the NVIDIA GPU data to temporary CPU buffers prior to  calling the libfabric HW collective functions.
